            "value" : "Forumind 適用於以 Discourse 架設的論壇。打開一個論壇，即可摘要話題、針對話題聊天，或向整個論壇提問。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forumind works with Discourse forums. It is an independent app and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Civilized Discourse Construction Kit, Inc. Discourse is a trademark of its respective owner." : {
      "localizations" : {
